.\" Manpage for @quincarter/create-lit-app
.TH CREATE-LIT-APP 1 "27 July 2026" "1.0.0" "create-lit-app Manual"
.SH NAME
create-lit-app \- Interactive CLI generator for Lit Element App Shell applications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B npx @quincarter/create-lit-app
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B create-lit-app
is an interactive CLI initializer that scaffolds production-ready Lit Element applications based on a modular App Shell architecture with optional Preact Signals, Lit Context, Lit Router, and UI component suites.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-name= \fINAME\fR
Set the project directory and package name (default: my-app-shell).
.TP
.BR \-\-template= \fITYPE\fR
Starter template preset: \fBfull\fR | \fBblank\fR | \fBcustom\fR (default: full).
.TP
.BR \-\-pm= \fIPM\fR
Package manager to use: \fByarn\fR | \fBnpm\fR (default: yarn).
.TP
.BR \-\-router ", " \-\-no-router
Enable or disable @lit-labs/router (automatically enables @lit/context).
.TP
.BR \-\-context ", " \-\-no-context
Enable or disable @lit/context dependency injection.
.TP
.BR \-\-signals ", " \-\-no-signals
Enable or disable Preact Signals and IndexedDB persistence.
.TP
.BR \-\-todos ", " \-\-no-todos
Enable or disable Signals Todo List component and view.
.TP
.BR \-\-cards ", " \-\-no-cards
Enable or disable Generic Card component and examples view.
.TP
.BR \-\-charts ", " \-\-no-charts
Enable or disable Chart.js wrapper component and examples view.
.TP
.BR \-\-header ", " \-\-no-header
Enable or disable AppShellHeader component.
.TP
.BR \-\-theme-switcher ", " \-\-no-theme-switcher
Enable or disable Theme Switcher component.
.TP
.BR \-\-mfe-loader ", " \-\-no-mfe-loader
Enable or disable Micro-Frontend (MFE) loader utility.
.TP
.BR \-\-git ", " \-\-no-git
Initialize Git repository (default: true).
.TP
.BR \-\-install ", " \-\-no-install
Run package manager dependency installation (default: false).
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Run non-interactively with current CLI flags.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Display version number.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help output.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B Interactive Scaffolding:
npx @quincarter/create-lit-app
.TP
.B Full Starter Preset:
npx @quincarter/create-lit-app --name=my-app --template=full
.TP
.B Custom Signals App:
npx @quincarter/create-lit-app --name=my-signals-app --template=custom --todos --signals --router --header
.SH AUTHOR
Quin Carter <quincarter>
